features.spec:
Parse df['conversation'] into turns using the header pattern r'(?:^|

)\[([^\]
]+)\]:' (speaker name in square brackets followed by colon at the start of text or after a blank line). Collect the speaker list in order. Return 1 if the number of distinct speakers >= 2 AND any speaker appears in >= 2 turns; else 0. Missing/non-string conversation -> null; empty string or no parsable turns -> 0. Reply links are not inferred; only repeated speaker turns among multiple speakers are used.

